      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc scale -n istio-system deployment/<new_gateway_deployment> --replicas <new_number_of_replicas>"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Decrease the number of replicas for the old gateway deployment by running the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc scale -n istio-system deployment/<old_gateway_deployment> --replicas <new_number_of_replicas>"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      <li>Repeat running the previous two commands. Each time, increase the number of replicas for the new gateway deployment and decrease the number of replicas for the old gateway deployment. Continue repeating until the new gateway deployment handles all traffic to the gateway <code>Service</code> object.</li>
      </ol>
      </li>
      <li>
      Remove the <code>app.kubernetes.io/managed-by</code> label from the gateway <code>Service</code> object by running the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc label service -n istio-system istio-ingressgateway app.kubernetes.io/managed-by-"} lang="terminal" />
      <p>Removing the label prevents the service from being deleted when the gateway is disabled in the <code>ServiceMeshControlPlane</code> resource.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      Remove the <code>ownerReferences</code> object from the gateway <code>Service</code> object by running the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc patch service -n istio-system istio-ingressgateway --type='json' -p='[{\"op\": \"remove\", \"path\": \"/metadata/ownerReferences\"}]'"} lang="terminal" />
      <p>Removing this object prevents the service from being garbage collected when the <code>ServiceMeshControlPlane</code> resource is deleted.</p>
